{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade","id":1396507,"title":"Wan Kuei, the Sabbat and the Gehenna crusade...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-14T15:48:16-07:00","id":1396507,"title":"Wan Kuei, the Sabbat and the Gehenna crusade...","content":"So I found a fun little quote in BJD while talking about all the other WK stuff.<br /> <br /> It comes as a surprise to all but E Division when<br /> the Wan Kuei begin a campaign of terror in the<br /> Middle East \u2014 in cities from Tehran to Medina.<br /> The Ashirra are stunned by the flagrant hostilities<br /> they\u2019d until now avoided. E Division knew the attacks<br /> were coming, and even helped orchestrate<br /> some of them. They quietly observed, making<br /> note of all active asuratziyya agents. E Division will<br /> be using their Archons and unknowing dupes to<br /> burn out the attackers, while rallying the Ashirra<br /> against the Wan Kuei \u2014 who they style as a mutual<br /> enemy. Is there a link between these attacks and<br /> the rise of the Gehenna Crusade the conservative<br /> Sabbat priesthood is preaching? The possibility of<br /> a Sabbat \u2014 Wan Kuei may be too terrible for most<br /> Kindred to consider. But what if it\u2019s true?<br /> <br /> I thought this was INTERESTING given what we now know about v5. The Ashirra have become close friends with the camarilla. The Sabbat has gone on Crusade.<br /> <br /> I've always thought of the WK has being presented as &quot;what if the systems in the sabbat you know.. actually worked?&quot; Dharmas actually are PATHS that lead to ENLIGHTENMENT rather than just ignoring the Beast. Wus are Packs with actual spiritual connections. Ritae are... rites.<br /> <br /> Add to this another Open storyhook from the long ago days Saulot and the WK. That he failed to figure out the key to becoming a WK. That enlightenment was just out of reach and then &quot;well maybe the pcs can figure out!&quot; occasionally popping up here and there but we also know that whatever Saulot's game with the Salubri, Tremere and the Salubri Antis seems to have come to a head with the Tremere breakup and Vienna being hit....<br /> <br /> We Also know broadly v5 is trying to combine groups decreasing the number of random factions. The Sabbat has even lost the church of caine interesting enough?<br /> <br /> So what if the next time we see the WK and the Sabbat they are one and the same? The Thousand Hungry Dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-14T17:17:08-07:00","id":1396546,"title":"","content":"Um I don't know about this. This is a really big reach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-14T17:39:07-07:00","id":1396557,"title":"","content":"I think of the Sabbat and Dharmas as very similar, yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T04:09:12-07:00","id":1396642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade#post1396507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I've always thought of the WK has being presented as &quot;what if the systems in the sabbat you know.. actually worked?&quot; Dharmas actually are PATHS that lead to ENLIGHTENMENT rather than just ignoring the Beast. Wus are Packs with actual spiritual connections. Ritae are... rites.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say you're wrong about this one,<br /> <br /> when sabbat and kj got their write up back in 2nd ed,<br /> the sabbat paths actually worked, they actually led to golconda (shoker I know)<br /> <br /> so no, the dharmas weren't &quot;paths that actually worked&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> in revised, the sabbat paths stopped leading to golconda,<br /> not really because they stopped working, but because the sabbat actively rejected golconda,<br /> in fact, it was considered heresy, and the Inquisition would hunt down golconda seekers,<br /> there were some paths that still sought for some form of enlightenment, but of a different kind (example of path of death that believed in an transcendance after death, or path metamorphosis, which isn't really a sabbat path, that had the whole azhi dahaka thing etc),<br /> the other paths simply embraced their damnation fully<br /> <br /> it's unclear what the sabbat thought about kj dharmas,<br /> the books kept avoiding the subject, or address it without committing to any definitive conclusion","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-18T03:01:47-07:00","id":1397255,"title":"","content":"Golconda was as much a &quot;myth&quot; in 2e as Revised. KOTE attempted to make the gaining of enlightenment, the transformation into an alien monster thing more front and center. That is the promise that I feel the Sabbat has fairly consistantly offered but failed at its all fiat. And if you are successful... you go leave the whole of kindred society.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-18T03:13:15-07:00","id":1397256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1397255#post1397255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Golconda was as much a &quot;myth&quot; in 2e as Revised. KOTE attempted to make the gaining of enlightenment, the transformation into an alien monster thing more front and center. That is the promise that I feel the Sabbat has fairly consistantly offered but failed at its all fiat. And if you are successful... you go leave the whole of kindred society.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, it was at least real in 2nd Edition when Rebekah had it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Auth