uo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1397975#post1397975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> yeah, this is...a pretty dumb take tbh<br /> <br /> the path of power was and should remain a modern path, with no ties to roads<br /> <br /> path of righteous night is the successor to the Road of Night,<br /> path of night is closer to the road of sin/devil,<br /> it's the polar opposite of the Road of Night</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, the Lasombra clan culture is literally, &quot;Fuck everyone who isn't me, kill the weak.&quot; So saying they didn't have a influence on the Path of Power and the Inner Voice is hard.<br /> <br /> Then again, maybe someone just read Ayn Rand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-21T06:54:43-07:00","id":1397978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1397977#post1397977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Then again, maybe someone just read Ayn Rand.</div> </div> </div> </div>actually, that's exactly what happened,<br /> some lasombra read a book from some darwinist nut and went: &quot;hey that could totally work for cainites&quot;, and the path of power was born<br /> <br /> Road of Night is more on the &quot;let's kill setites and godless heathens&quot; side of things","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-21T07:15:59-07:00","id":1397979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1397957#post1397957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh, they flat out canonized it and gave rules for it in STATE OF GRACE I believe.<br /> <br /> Which is about time.<br /> <br /> Golconda should be real, attainable, and not a myth, IMHO. That's just my campaign, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>its Not particularly impressive, very much full of complete st fiat bits, dharma and mage seekings aren't that in depth but do provide more engagement<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-21T10:57:05-07:00","id":1398018,"title":"","content":"Nirvana is a trap, you can only win through collectively slaying God, the demiurge.you cannot escape the prison of reality, you must destroy it!<br /> <br /> /maximum edge (but probably correct)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 06-21-2020, 01:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T07:31:42-07:00","id":1398356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1397978#post1397978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Road of Night is more on the &quot;let's kill setites and godless heathens&quot; side of things</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, come on... why anyone can't let the Setites just snake around without trying to exterminate them?<br /> &quot;Kill the Setites&quot; is some filler for when you don't have enough moral principles to fill ten lines?<br /> (\u00ac_\u00ac)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/250518/Dark-Shores-Lineages--of-the-Great-Lakes\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Dark Shores: Lineages of the Great Lakes</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/264262/Fingers-of-the-Eldest-Bogatyri\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Fingers of the Eldest: Bogatyri</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/295115/Forgotten-Alliances\" target=\"_blank\">WTA: Forgotten Alliances</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24483-salamander","name":"SalamanDer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24483_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T10:14:09-07:00","id":1398377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SalamanDer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1398356#post1398356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, come on... why anyone can't let the Setites just snake around without trying to exterminate them?<br /> &quot;Kill the Setites&quot; is some filler for when you don't have enough moral principles to fill ten lines?<br /> (\u00ac_\u00ac)</div> </div> </div> </div>yeah, well, road of night are catholic,<br /> after Baali got destroyed, they needed a new target<br /> <br /> setites were pagans...gnostics...perfect fit<br /> <br /> fortunately for the setites, the cainite heresy happened...not that setites didn't enjoy being hunted down (they built their whole career around being the target of everyone including werewolves and weredragons...weredragons for fuck's sake)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T10:33:38-07:00","id":1398381,"title":"","content":"I always found it funny that everyone suspects the Setites when literally <b>EVERYONE</b> is up to something. I like using that against my players, they make great red herrings to throw them off the trail.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14519-drhappyangry","name":"DrHappyAngry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14519_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T12:18:03-07:00","id":1398402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrHappyAngry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1398381#post1398381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I always found it funny that everyone suspects the Setites when literally <b>EVERYONE</b> is up to something. I like using that against my players, they make great red herrings to throw them off the trail.</div> </div> </div> </div>Once I did an experiment.<br /> We were playing a story and I placed a Setite in the city. The Setite Stereotype in all its full-glory.<br /> He was quite the charming guy, polite and quiet.<br /> He had a shop of ethnic trinkets acting as front for a store for Kindred.<br /> He was basically in the store all the time save for weekends, that he used spending in the Elysium playing chess games against a local Malkavian Elder.<br /> All his hidden agenda was to get Boons from Kindred in his back-entry-store that he reinvested in acquiring Cainite artifacts to send his Elders (he was aquaintance with Hesha Ruhadze).<br /> And he was really just this. As I said, the Setite stereotype in its full-glory but without doing literally nothing wrong to anyone (and being nice).<br /> <br /> <br /> Guess my players' reaction?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">They suspected him to be the source of EVERY problem in the city.<br /> Garou kidnapping any bloodsucker roaming the countryside. Two Methuselah warring through their proxies. The whole Clan Ventrue struggling in an internecine civil war because all the damn blue blood of the city were sure they could get praxis. A family of cannibal revenants living on an houseboat at some miles from the port. <b>That</b> Salubri that incidentally wanders in your city just to get killed by the local Tremere, in EVERY story. A witch-hunter and even a Sabbat Crusade.<br /> <br /> They thought that the Setite had his hands in all of this (in different moments, basically the Setite was the first suspect every time a dog farted).<br /> <br /> Then, when the Sabbat Crusade struck, the Setite found them trying to hide: hungry, injured and defenseless. He gave them nourishment, a safe place to sleep and weapons good enough to deal with Sabbat.<br /> And after the Crusade failed, with all the shitload of Boons they had handed in exchange for support, they basically started doing freelance tomb-raiding for the Setite.<br /> <br /> You don't know how much I laughed in that story.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/250518/Dark-Shores-Lineages--of-the-Great-Lakes\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Dark Shores: Lineages of the Great Lakes</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/264262/Fingers-of-the-Eldest-Bogatyri\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Fingers of the Eldest: Bogatyri</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/295115/Forgotten-Alliances\" target=\"_blank\">WTA: Forgotten Alliances</a>","edited":{"userid":24483,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24483-salamander","user":"SalamanDer","date":".  typos 06-23-2020, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24483-salamander","name":"SalamanDer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24483_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T14:23:33-07:00","id":1398435,"title":"","content":"Settites are the good guys (for vampires, I don't wanna be round them as a human) <br /> <br /> Want to save humanity<br /> Main enemy is god (Who's the big bad in this setting, let's be honest) <br /> Give you what you need when you ask. <br /> Teach magic to anyone who joins their religion<br /> Have all the fun things. <br /> <br /> People don't trust them because they're just so good. They make everyone else look bad. They're victims of jealousy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T20:41:11-07:00","id":1398518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1396507-wan-kuei-the-sabbat-and-the-gehenna-crusade?p=1397965#post1397965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Church of Caine sounds very Gnostic.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u201cGnostics\u201d is actually their nickname in Cults of the Blood Gods. <br /> <br /> Fun fact: Ken Hite &amp; Jenna Moran based the original Dark Ages Cainite Heresy on <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cainites\" target=\"_blank\">a real gnostic heresy</a>, with very little alteration to make it fit the WoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}